                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "content": " project, to reconstruct Gordon Pask’s seminal interactive art piece \"Colloquy of Mobiles,\" which appeared in the groundbreaking exhibition \"Cybernetic Serendipity\" in London in 1968. Their 2018 reconstruction was exhibited at Centre Pompidou in 2020 and is now part of the permanent collection at ZKM.",
